      value: "You are now located in the city centre of Lyon, France.\r\nYou have
        10 minutes to explore and memorize the area.\r\nThe area consists of two
        parts located on the east and west banks of the river.\r\nYou will first
        explore one part of the area. After 5 minutes, a prompt will appear. Once
        confirmed, you will be automatically teleported to the other side of the
        river to continue exploring for another 5 minutes.\r"
